    "The Aftermatter result is reproduced at commit 70a1c341d478bc37bf1ed0206dad4ee507cf743d; Core does not rerun Aftermatter.",
    "The intervals bound only Aftermatter's recorded decimal-floor and rounding error. Nuclear-data, activation-model, regulatory-model, and scenario uncertainty are not evaluated.",
    "All facility routes remain unresolved at 50 years. Their categorical states are retained in the route-result artifact and are not converted into numeric requirement claims.",
